{
  "id": "984",
  "title": "50 or 98 Years Old?",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2020-06-19",
  "synopsis": "Little He has a riddle for Lili. Do you get it?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/984/59c4edbdf253a197052c4ad2e40918784e70497d.mp3?1592124062",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "五十岁还是九十八岁？\n\n小何：亲爱的，我有一个问题想考考你。\n丽丽：你问吧。\n小何：哥哥今年四岁，弟弟的年龄是哥哥的一半。那哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟多大？\n丽丽：弟弟五十岁！\n小何：你再想想！\n丽丽：弟弟的年龄是哥哥的一半。那哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟就是五十岁！\n小何：你错了！哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟九十八岁！\n丽丽：一百的一半就是五十！\n小何：好吧，你再去好好想想吧！",
    "traditional": "五十歲還是九十八歲？\n\n小何：親愛的，我有一個問題想考考你。\n麗麗：你問吧。\n小何：哥哥今年四歲，弟弟的年齡是哥哥的一半。那哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟多大？\n麗麗：弟弟五十歲！\n小何：你再想想！\n麗麗：弟弟的年齡是哥哥的一半。那哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟就是五十歲！\n小何：你錯了！哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟九十八歲！\n麗麗：一百的一半就是五十！\n小何：好吧，你再去好好想想吧！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "50 Years or 98 Years Old?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小何：亲爱的，我有一个问题想考考你。",
      "traditional": "小何：親愛的，我有一個問題想考考你。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé qīn ài de wǒ yǒu yí ge wèn tí xiǎng kǎo kǎo nǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Darling, I have a question I want to test on you."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "丽丽：你问吧。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：你問吧。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì nǐ wèn ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Ok, ask me."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "小何：哥哥今年四岁，弟弟的年龄是哥哥的一半。",
      "traditional": "小何：哥哥今年四歲，弟弟的年齡是哥哥的一半。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé gē ge jīn nián sì suì dì di de nián líng shì gē ge de yí bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "那哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟多大？",
      "traditional": "那哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟多大？",
      "pinyin": "nà gē ge yì bǎi suì de shí hou dì di duō dà",
      "english": "Little He: The elder brother is 4 years old this year, and the younger brother is half the age of the elder brother."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So when the elder brother is 100 years old, how old is the younger brother?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "丽丽：弟弟五十岁！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：弟弟五十歲！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì dì di wǔ shí suì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: The younger brother will be 50 years old!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "小何：你再想想！",
      "traditional": "小何：你再想想！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ zài xiǎng xiǎng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Think about it again!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "丽丽：弟弟的年龄是哥哥的一半。",
      "traditional": "麗麗：弟弟的年齡是哥哥的一半。",
      "pinyin": "lì lì dì di de nián líng shì gē ge de yí bàn",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "那哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟就是五十岁！",
      "traditional": "那哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟就是五十歲！",
      "pinyin": "nà gē ge yì bǎi suì de shí hou dì di jiù shì wǔ shí suì",
      "english": "Lili: The younger brother is half the age of the elder brother."
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "So when the elder brother is 100 years old, the younger brother will be 50 years old!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小何：你错了！哥哥一百岁的时候，弟弟九十八岁！",
      "traditional": "小何：你錯了！哥哥一百歲的時候，弟弟九十八歲！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé nǐ cuò le gē ge yì bǎi suì de shí hou dì di jiǔ shí bā suì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: You’re wrong! When the elder brother is 100 years old, the younger brother will be 98 years old!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "丽丽：一百的一半就是五十！",
      "traditional": "麗麗：一百的一半就是五十！",
      "pinyin": "lì lì yì bǎi de yí bàn jiù shì wǔ shí",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Lili: Half of 100 is 50!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "小何：好吧，你再去好好想想吧！",
      "traditional": "小何：好吧，你再去好好想想吧！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo hé hǎo ba nǐ zài qù hǎo hǎo xiǎng xiǎng ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little He: Fine, go and carefully think about it some more."
    }
  ],
